      "writtenOn": "2023-05-18T15:56:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve added the conversion in apex.go and apex_conversion_test.go.\n\nI spent some time trying to update build/bazel/rules/apex/apex.bzl but I can\u0027t figure out how it works and where are the corresponding bazel parts. Could you please help with the bazel side of this change?",
